// # Scripts Inventory Board
// Logline: Document all retained governance tools, generators, production smokes, and pruned artifacts in ASD-STE100.
// Setup: Read-only inspection across openOODA/scripts/, ooda/scripts/, and centralized QA suites.
// Beats:
//   1. Classify 22 retained openOODA governance and static site generator tools.
//   2. Catalog 1,144 retained ooda backend compiler locks and std_qa suites.
