//   5. Define deterministic verification commands and validation gates.

## 1. Overview & Inventory Scope

This process board catalogs all operational scripts across openOODA and ooda repositories.
The taxonomy organizes tools into four functional categories:
1. Governance Linters & Gate Enforcers: Verify repository file laws, line limits, and headers.
2. Code Generators & Manifest Builders: Build static sites, registries, and release manifests.
3. Active Production Smoke Tests: Validate compiler backends, standard libraries, and security invariants.
4. Pruned Legacy Smokes & Transient Artifacts: Eliminated redundant tests and compilation debris.

Total retained scripts in openOODA/scripts/: 22 files (100% pure .oo, all <= 256 lines).
Total retained scripts in ooda/scripts/: 1,144 .oo files and 2 .oot specification files.

