| `verify_all.oo` | `&SysCap` | Master release verification gateway verifying SHIPPED freshness and RFC compliance. |
| `anti_cheat_linter.oo` | `&SysCap` | AST static linter detecting mock booleans, untyped sentinels, and trailing commas. |
| `audit_library_capabilities.oo` | `&FsReadCap` | Standard library crawler verifying zero ambient authority across ooda/std/. |
| `rfc_lint.oo` | `&SysCap` | Fail-closed RFC template compliance linter validating mandatory RFC sections. |
