## 3. ooda/scripts/ Architecture & Category Mapping (1,144 Files)

### 3.1 Backend Compiler Locks & Native Smoke Proofs (890 Files in Root ooda/scripts/)

| Subsystem & Domain | File Count | ASD-STE100 Description & Capabilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Standard Library & Runtime Smokes (`std_*`, `c_*`) | 379 | Validates core data structures, algorithms, I/O, and C runtime integration. |
| WASM Engine & Codegen Smokes (`wasm_*`) | 172 | Verifies WebAssembly bytecode generation, stack lowering, and runtime execution. |
| x86 SSA & ELF Codegen Smokes (`x86_*`, `ssa_*`) | 119 | Validates mem2reg SSA optimization, register allocation, and direct ELF emission. |
| Milestone & Stage Proofs (`stage*`, `smoke_m4_*`) | 90 | Verifies architectural milestone gates and language evolution stages. |
| AArch64 Backend Smokes (`aarch64_*`, `a64_*`) | 79 | Validates ARM64 instruction selection, AAPCS64 ABI, and NEON vector operations. |
| Security & Sandbox Proofs (`cap_*`, `hostile_*`) | 24 | Proves capability security bounds, secret taint tracking, and Landlock sandboxing. |
| LLVM Backend Smokes (`llvm_*`) | 14 | Validates LLVM IR lowering, optimization passes, and LTO integration. |
| Governance Linters & Gate Enforcers | 7 | Repository-level static smoke runners and standard library integrity checkers. |
| Code Generators & AST Transformers | 6 | AST transformers, stub generators, and test pipeline scaffolding tools. |

