## 6. Deterministic Verification Commands

Execute these commands to verify repository tools and governance compliance:

1. Master Strategic Governance Linter:
   `./bin/ooda run openOODA/scripts/enforcer.oo`

2. 12-Board Hygiene & Audit Budget Checker:
   `cd openOODA && ../ooda/bin/ooda run scripts/check_board.oo`

3. Master Release Verification Gateway:
   `cd openOODA && ../ooda/bin/ooda run scripts/verify_all.oo`

4. Live Lock Verifier & SHIPPED Generator:
   `cd openOODA && ../ooda/bin/ooda run scripts/generate_shipped.oo`

5. Standard Library Multi-Slice QA Suite:
   `cd ooda && ./bin/ooda run scripts/std_qa/std_qa_master.oo`

6. Central Master QA Test Suite:
   `./bin/ooda run qa/qa_master.oo`

7. Debris Residual Hygiene Assertion:
   `find openOODA/scripts ooda/scripts qa -type f \( -name "*.bin" -o -name "*.tmp.c" -o -name "*.oo.bin" \)`
